{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07596","headline":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 四 · 萧颖士","name":"仰荅韦司业垂访五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彭阳昔游说，愿谒南郢都。\n王果尚未达，况从夷节谟。\n岂知晋叔向，无罪婴囚拘。\n临难俟解纷，独知[祁]大夫。\n举讐且不弃，何必论亲疎。\n夫子觉者也，其能遗我乎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}